{"app":"jollof-studio","version":1,"name":"Collège : réseau d’un bâtiment de deux étages","description":"Un projet de professionnel : bâtiment de 48 × 17 m sur deux niveaux, 26 pièces, un local technique par étage (baie 42U, panneaux, switchs PoE+, onduleur), rocade fibre OM4 entre les étages, cœur de niveau 3 avec quatre VLAN (données, voix, Wi-Fi, gestion), DHCP et DNS par relais, routeur d’accès à Internet avec traduction d’adresses, 17 points d’accès Wi-Fi 6 avec plan de canaux, 95 prises aux longueurs réelles, liens certifiés. Vues Plans, Baies et Conception.","en":{"name":"Middle school: network of a two-storey building","description":"A professional project: a 48 × 17 m building on two levels, 26 rooms, one telecom room per floor (42U rack, patch panels, PoE+ switches, UPS), an OM4 fibre backbone between the floors, a layer-3 core with four VLANs (data, voice, Wi-Fi, management), DHCP and DNS through a relay, an Internet access router with address translation, 17 Wi-Fi 6 access points with a channel plan, 95 outlets with real lengths, certified links. Floor plans, Racks and Design views."},"comps":[],"wires":[],"settings":{"kind":"net","dur":1.2,"env":{"temp":24,"hum":55,"press":1013,"lux":300,"dist":35,"motion":0,"soil":40,"gas":0,"sound":45,"tilt":0},"prog":{"rules":[],"boards":{}},"modules":{"net":{"devices":[{"id":"ap1","type":"ap6","x":428,"y":650,"name":"AP1","p":{"ssid":"Atelier","pass":"jollof2024","power":"poe","poeClass":4,"radios":{"b24":{"on":false,"ch":1,"w":20,"tx":8,"gain":4},"b5":{"on":true,"ch":104,"w":20,"tx":14,"gain":5}}},"loc":{"floor":"f0","x":5.5,"y":5.1,"h":2.8}},{"id":"ap2","type":"ap6","x":596,"y":650,"name":"AP2","p":{"ssid":"Atelier","pass":"jollof2024","power":"poe","poeClass":4,"radios":{"b24":{"on":false,"ch":1,"w":20,"tx":8,"gain":4},"b5":{"on":true,"ch":40,"w":20,"tx":14,"gain":5}}},"loc":{"floor":"f0","x":13.5,"y":5.1,"h":2.8}},{"id":"ap3","type":"ap6","x":764,"y":650,"name":"AP3","p":{"ssid":"Atelier","pass":"jollof2024","po